{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122083043310-1122_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261122084816\"/><p>佳翠苑行人路地底有水管爆裂。</p><p>小西灣發生爆生爆水管。今晨(22日)7時05分，小西灣道16號佳翠苑近入口位置，行人路地底有水管爆裂，水流夾着沙泥，湧上行人路及行車路，車輛需減涉水而行。執法部門接報到場，將受影響道路封閉，並通知水務署派員閂水掣及維修。據了解，涉事水管為鹹水管。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T01:03:45.840741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T00:30:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T02:35:17.351198+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T00:57:20.129074+00:00","content_hash":"5952e33325a1401d0167789f8c1908eade2992b64651648f65e83e3819711d33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}